``` Turla Cereal: Exchange Server Espionage Toolset
    Field names follow CIM/UDM conventions and have not been tested against live data; adjust them to your environment.
    Splunk hunt over raw events, for data not mapped to CIM. Author: daniyyell-dev. https://github.com/daniyyell-dev/rapid-threat-intel/tree/main/threats/2026-11_November-2026/2026-11-10/Turla-Cereal-Exchange-Espionage-Toolset
    Sources: https://web-assets.esetstatic.com/wls/en/papers/white-papers/turla-cereal-tricks.pdf
    Define the rti_network, rti_dns, rti_web and rti_endpoint macros once (example: all/splunk_macros.conf).
    Each macro takes one argument, a list of search terms used to pre-filter the raw events, and must only use
    streaming commands (search, eval, rename, rex, fields, spath) so it can run inside multisearch.
    Set the time picker to at least the last 30 days. The indicators below are live and malicious.
    Output: first_seen, last_seen, ioc, ioc_type, data_model, host, user, src, dest, detail, count ```
search `rti_endpoint(4a3c263977417fb6977b0e598c9e3bc5924f390c OR 7742c6b0aaf114335cef7ebab11290cb18a0b8b3 OR afe448dd95494cd14438f04f0c5f6b384664a3b7 OR 4a65040646e354303f067d47aa1c953d467f65cb OR d1e17520a2435edcdcc47f582381416fbdf75f94 OR 7ab784d0049890d9844aee7f214ba173e3cc23be OR 5d80118b1ee974936322475f740ab3aeff70b8f3 OR d51c58c2e95d4561848e0a5a8b9fb33c847c50a4 OR 5b94fe76ec4feb0b5cb6ea3bca4c48d2fe22597b OR 1408a8f62b09a5ad0dff279b2878d8f59f70a330 OR 3d1a534ce0d0c293f62ece556cbc6d0728213104 OR ad85fbf2cc879d4325bce1e6fb5f12ab59e3d387 OR 3ea03188dba8898d97e965732c1d6a68c5437edc OR 3fba18af966deacf7ae09e4d4238952dd90a6d6f OR eb9ba1da5363f5d04e2f98673595fce93f39a78e OR 0b4e4a1ce7fee91bfc62b2a2ec572c325642bb60 OR a4e477ce257f2c635401ef554e05506c080967c0 OR a5be8706032a0798fd63214a9f22efa6309355f5)`
| search file_hash IN ("*4a3c263977417fb6977b0e598c9e3bc5924f390c*", "*7742c6b0aaf114335cef7ebab11290cb18a0b8b3*", "*afe448dd95494cd14438f04f0c5f6b384664a3b7*", "*4a65040646e354303f067d47aa1c953d467f65cb*", "*d1e17520a2435edcdcc47f582381416fbdf75f94*", "*7ab784d0049890d9844aee7f214ba173e3cc23be*", "*5d80118b1ee974936322475f740ab3aeff70b8f3*", "*d51c58c2e95d4561848e0a5a8b9fb33c847c50a4*", "*5b94fe76ec4feb0b5cb6ea3bca4c48d2fe22597b*", "*1408a8f62b09a5ad0dff279b2878d8f59f70a330*", "*3d1a534ce0d0c293f62ece556cbc6d0728213104*", "*ad85fbf2cc879d4325bce1e6fb5f12ab59e3d387*", "*3ea03188dba8898d97e965732c1d6a68c5437edc*", "*3fba18af966deacf7ae09e4d4238952dd90a6d6f*", "*eb9ba1da5363f5d04e2f98673595fce93f39a78e*", "*0b4e4a1ce7fee91bfc62b2a2ec572c325642bb60*", "*a4e477ce257f2c635401ef554e05506c080967c0*", "*a5be8706032a0798fd63214a9f22efa6309355f5*") OR process_hash IN ("*4a3c263977417fb6977b0e598c9e3bc5924f390c*", "*7742c6b0aaf114335cef7ebab11290cb18a0b8b3*", "*afe448dd95494cd14438f04f0c5f6b384664a3b7*", "*4a65040646e354303f067d47aa1c953d467f65cb*", "*d1e17520a2435edcdcc47f582381416fbdf75f94*", "*7ab784d0049890d9844aee7f214ba173e3cc23be*", "*5d80118b1ee974936322475f740ab3aeff70b8f3*", "*d51c58c2e95d4561848e0a5a8b9fb33c847c50a4*", "*5b94fe76ec4feb0b5cb6ea3bca4c48d2fe22597b*", "*1408a8f62b09a5ad0dff279b2878d8f59f70a330*", "*3d1a534ce0d0c293f62ece556cbc6d0728213104*", "*ad85fbf2cc879d4325bce1e6fb5f12ab59e3d387*", "*3ea03188dba8898d97e965732c1d6a68c5437edc*", "*3fba18af966deacf7ae09e4d4238952dd90a6d6f*", "*eb9ba1da5363f5d04e2f98673595fce93f39a78e*", "*0b4e4a1ce7fee91bfc62b2a2ec572c325642bb60*", "*a4e477ce257f2c635401ef554e05506c080967c0*", "*a5be8706032a0798fd63214a9f22efa6309355f5*") OR parent_process_hash IN ("*4a3c263977417fb6977b0e598c9e3bc5924f390c*", "*7742c6b0aaf114335cef7ebab11290cb18a0b8b3*", "*afe448dd95494cd14438f04f0c5f6b384664a3b7*", "*4a65040646e354303f067d47aa1c953d467f65cb*", "*d1e17520a2435edcdcc47f582381416fbdf75f94*", "*7ab784d0049890d9844aee7f214ba173e3cc23be*"